# Bot1's Mutavault is animated (a creature only on the battlefield) in response to the spell and dies to it, counted as the creature it last was (CR 603.10a).
# Black Lotus pays {1}{B}{B} and four Moxen are tapped for the waterbend {4} (the fifth, Emerald, stays untapped: it pays for Mutavault). All creatures get -2/-2: Bot1's Mutavault and
# Bot2's Ornithopter die (+2 life, one per creature, both players' creatures count) and Bot2's Patchwork Beastie (3/3) survives as a 1/1, so
# the -2/-2 is exactly two. The effect and the trigger end with the turn: on turn 5 the Beastie dies to Lightning Bolt and gains nothing.

